Permitted Modifications do not include new features, functional expansions,
architectural redesigns, performance enhancements beyond maintenance needs,
UI/UX redesigns, or adaptation of the Software for use as a general-purpose
framework, library, or product.

“Public-Facing Site” means a website or web application operated by Licensee
and made accessible to the general public, where the Software is used solely
